  "description": "Pure-managed BMP / DIB decoder and encoder for .NET, SIMD-accelerated (AVX2 / SSSE3 / AdvSimd). Decodes every Windows and OS/2 variant: core, OS/2 2.x, BITMAPINFOHEADER, V4 and V5 headers; 1/2/4/8-bit palettes, 16/24/32-bit, BI_BITFIELDS and BI_ALPHABITFIELDS masks, RLE4 / RLE8 with deltas, OS/2 RLE24 and Huffman 1D, embedded PNG, bottom-up and top-down rows, embedded ICC profiles, and headerless packed DIBs (clipboard, icon images with their AND mask). Encodes 1/4/8-bit palettes (exact, or Wu-quantized with optional dithering), RLE4 / RLE8, 16-bit 555 / 565, 24-bit and 32-bit with alpha. Spec-derived. AOT-compatible.",
